3.33.m:
Yudhiṣṭhira said:
The glorification of Vārāṇasī has been related by you in brief;
tell it in detail, O sage, for then my mind will be delighted.

The Lord said:
Inexpressible is this special realization here, knowledge excluded by the ignorant;
I shall tell you according to truth that which has been spoken by supreme ṛṣis.
